OL,5,G0630 Breakfast
OL,6,     FMark Forrest presents Radio 3's
OL,7,     FBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,8,     Femail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,9,G0900 Sunday Morning
OL,10,     FJoin Sarah Walker for a Sunday
OL,11,     Fmix, from Baroque brilliance and
OL,12,     Fmedieval choral music to Russian
OL,13,     Fsymphonic drama, plus a little
OL,14,     Fencouragement to enjoy that extra
OL,15,     Fhour in bed.
OL,16,G1200 Private Passions
OL,17,     FMichael Berkeley's guest is the
OL,18,     Fcomedy performer, writer and Monty
OL,19,     FPython star Eric Idle.
