OL,13,     FConcerto Copenhagen with director
OL,14,     Fand harpsichordist Lars Ulrik
OL,15,     FMortensen and vocalist Marc
OL,16,     FMauillon perform music by Rore,
OL,17,     FMarini, Strozzi, Peri, Castello,
OL,18,     FCaccini and Monteverdi.
